    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2003013110160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "テレビに出てるわたしって\r\nほんとのわたしとはちょっと違うっていうか",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301311/2003013110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003013110170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "不思議だなーって見ちゃうんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301311/2003013110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003013110180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あっ、今回のお仕事だけの話じゃないよ？\r\nずっとそう！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301311/2003013110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003013110190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ちょっとびっくりするの\r\n『芸能人みたい！』って",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301311/2003013110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003013110200,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "きっとだけど、これからもずっと感じ続けるんだと思うなー",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301311/2003013110200"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2003013110210,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "真乃と灯織と一緒にいることとか、\r\nこうしてプロデューサーと一緒にいることとか",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301311/2003013110210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003013110220,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしの中ではもう生活の一部って感じで\r\n特別なことじゃなくなってるんだけど",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301311/2003013110220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "autoWaitTime": 800
  },
  {
    "id": 2003013110230,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "こうやってテレビの中に自分がいるのを見ると\r\nわたしも『テレビに出てる人』なんだよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301311/2003013110230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003013110240,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "何も知らないお客さんからしたら、\r\nわたしはお店のメイドさんだから──",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301311/2003013110240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003013110250,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "１日しか研修してないからとか\r\n本業じゃないからとか、そういうの理由にしたくなくて",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301311/2003013110250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003013110260,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "それに、中途半端って\r\n他のメイドさんに対しても失礼になるし……って",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301311/2003013110260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003013110270,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "思ってたんだけど\r\nちょっと間違えちゃってたなって",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301311/2003013110270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐるが色々考えてやったことだから\r\n間違いだとは思わないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それに、それはすごく大事な感覚なんじゃないかな\r\nなくしちゃダメなやつだって俺は思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003013110280,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そっか\r\n……うん、なくさないようにする",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301311/2003013110280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003013110290,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "でも……でもね\r\nやっぱり、それだけじゃダメだったんだなぁって",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301311/2003013110290"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003013110300,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "収録の時ね\r\nちゃんとメイドさんになることばっかりで……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301311/2003013110300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003013110310,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "テレビのこと意識できてなくて、\r\nそれってほんとはダメなんだよーって……！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301311/2003013110310"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003013110320,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "他の企画に出てる人たちを見てて思いました！\r\nというのが今回の気付き！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301311/2003013110320"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003013110330,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "バラエティーもテレビに出るのも難しー！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301311/2003013110330"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003013110340,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ねぇねぇ、プロデューサー！\r\nまたこういうオファーあったら絶対やらせてね！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0327",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301311/2003013110340"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003013110350,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "リベンジ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
